    "layout": "The layout is clean and centered within a generous max-width container (approx. 1440px). The header is full-width with a 1px bottom border. The hero area is a simple centered stack comprising a headline, a large input field, and suggestion chips. Body sections are separated by large vertical whitespace (~96px) on the Canvas (#fafafa) background, creating a spacious rhythm. Content grids, such as the 3-column template gallery, are the primary structure for displaying information.",
